{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Susārada","html":"<article id='thag1.75'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.75 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.75 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Aṭṭhamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eight </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Susāradattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Susārada </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sādhu suvihitāna dassanaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Good is the sight of those who’ve practiced well: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kaṅkhā chijjati buddhi vaḍḍhati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>doubt is cut off and intelligence grows—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bālampi karonti paṇḍitaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>even a fool grows wise! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tasmā sādhu sataṁ samāgamo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>That’s why it’s good to meet good people. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Susārado thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
